--   Dusart finite mesh: certified upper group 119, part 4
-- statement:
--   Finite natural-number data and kernel-checked certificate equations for one contiguous interval in the finite verification supporting Dusart’s fourth-power logarithmic theta estimate. The exported generic interval certificate states that any sound interpretation of the block checker, closed under interval composition, validates this entire interval. All numerical equations and the constructor proof are included. No unproved theorem is introduced.
